ource>Cell Death Differ.</source> <volume>10</volume>:<fpage>404</fpage>&#x02013;408.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12719716</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib21"><citation citation-type="journal">Hochheimer, A., and R. Tjian. <year>2003</year>. Diversified transcription initiation complexes expand promoter selectivity and tissue-specific gene expression. <source>Genes Dev.</source> <volume>17</volume>:<fpage>1309</fpage>&#x02013;1320.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12782648</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib22"><citation citation-type="journal">Ko, L.J., and C. Prives. <year>1996</year>. p53: puzzle and paradigm. <source>Genes Dev.</source> <volume>10</volume>:<fpage>1054</fpage>&#x02013;1072.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8654922</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib23"><citation citation-type="journal">Li, B., S. Boast, K. de los Santos, I. Schieren, M. Quiroz, S.L. Teitelbaum, M.M. Tondravi, and S.P. Goff. <year>2000</year>. Mice deficient in Abl are osteoporotic and have defects in osteoblast maturation. <source>Nat. Genet.</source> <volume>24</volume>:<fpage>304</fpage>&#x02013;308.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10700189</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib24"><citation citation-type="journal">Li, B., X. Wang, N. Rasheed, Y. Hu, S. Boast, T. Ishii, K. Nakayama, K.I. Nakayama, and S.P. Goff. <year>2004</year>. Distinct roles of c-Abl and Atm in oxidative stress response are mediated by protein kinase C {delta}. <source>Genes Dev.</source> <volume>18</volume>:<fpage>1824</fpage>&#x02013;1837.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15289456</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib25"><citation citation-type="journal">Manolagas, S.C., and R.L. Jilka. <year>1995</year>. Bone marrow, cytokines, and bone remodeling. Emerging insights into the pathophysiology of osteoporosis. <source>N. Engl. J. Med.</source> <volume>332</volume>:<fpage>305</fpage>&#x02013;311.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7816067</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib26"><citation citation-type="journal">Murphy, M., A. Hinman, an